"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4899230","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3508880-1846651706691747","game_id":"steam-3508880","kind":"announcement","title":"We're on Steam Next Fest!","summary":"We're on a Steam Next Fest!I'm happy to announce that you can play the Outpost Simulator demo during Steam Next Fest! The demo has been out for a while now, and I've seen how much you've enjoyed it. I've taken every review, discussion topic, and social media comment into consideration, and they've helped shape the game. Your feedback matters, so I'd love to hear more! It means a lot to me.From the bottom of my heart: thank you.Remember to wishlist our game! We'll see you soon with more updates!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:22:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691747","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3508880-1846651706687740","game_id":"steam-3508880","kind":"update","title":"Update / Patch Notes Version 1.3.4","summary":"Fixed bugs that could cause the game to freeze.Added an in-game map with zoom functionality and explored-area tracking.Added a minimap for easier navigation.Added a menu to switch between your backpack, objectives, and other panels.Fixed a crash when tents were placed too close together.Fixed a crash when launching the game through Steam.Fixed freezes while saving and while loading a large base.Fixed cases where you could not move or look around after closing a menu.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T18:41:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687740","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3508880-1845383656386153","game_id":"steam-3508880","kind":"update","title":"Update / Patch Notes Version 1.3.1","summary":"Version 1.3.1 – Improvements & FixesFixed numerous issues that could cause crashes and freezes.Fixed a turret firing issue. Turrets will now stop firing when an object blocks their line of sight.Selling prices are now automatically set to the recommended price, so you no longer need to update them manually each time.Added a new UI indicator showing the current selling price.Improved the Gravity Gun, including better visual effects and several bug fixes.Added two new graphics settings:FPS Limit: ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T12:25:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386153","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3508880-1843481262701119","game_id":"steam-3508880","kind":"update","title":"DEVLOG #03 Development Update (v1.3.0)","summary":"Hello everyone,We’ve been a little late with our Dev Log as we’ve been busy working on the demo and the game itself. Thank you for your patience. Since the demo was released, we’ve received a lot of wishlists and many great comments. We sincerely thank everyone who has enjoyed and supported the game.We’ll continue updating the demo. We’ve also been receiving bug reports from you, and we’re reviewing and fixing them. With the full version, aim to provide a completely polished and bug-free gamepla","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T09:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701119","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3508880-1842212951302917","game_id":"steam-3508880","kind":"update","title":"10,000+ Wishlists Reached — Update Notes","summary":"First of all, thank you! Outpost Simulator has officially reached 10,000+ wishlists. Your feedback and support have helped shape the demo, and this update focuses on stability, balance, and quality-of-life improvements.What's New - Version 1.2Fixed several crash-causing issues.Updated the farming system, making production more reliable.Rebalanced the in-game economy for a better gameplay experience.Improved enemy attack waves for better balance and pacing.Added the option to rebind the Q key for","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T11:39:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951302917","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3508880-1841579228668359","game_id":"steam-3508880","kind":"announcement","title":"Outpost Simulator DEMO Is OUT NOW!","summary":"The Outpost Simulator Demo is ready!Countless hours of building, testing, and refining have led us to this moment: the gates of the outpost are swinging open. The Outpost Simulator Demo is about to launch, and we are thrilled to invite you inside. This is just the first step on our journey. We want to shape the game side by side with our community, so your feedback, ideas, and bug reports are important. Every message you send will help us discover what shines, what needs a little more polish, an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T11:00:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228668359","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3508880-1841579228665427","game_id":"steam-3508880","kind":"announcement","title":"The Outpost Simulator Demo Launches Tomorrow!","summary":"The outpost is waiting. The survivors are counting on you.In only one day, you will set foot in the wasteland and breathe new life into a forgotten settlement, transforming it into a sanctuary worth defending. Construct shelters, nurture your fellow survivors, master your resources, strengthen your skills, and brace yourself for the dangers that creep in after nightfall. The first step toward rebuilding starts tomorrow. Add Outpost Simulator to your wishlist now and prepare to claim your place i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T13:00:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228665427","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3508880-1840944183788475","game_id":"steam-3508880","kind":"announcement","title":"3 Days Until the Outpost Simulator Demo!","summary":"The wasteland holds its breath, waiting for you.In just 3 days, your journey begins: rebuild your outpost, rescue desperate survivors, scavenge for precious resources, and steel yourself for the first wave of raids. Are you ready to shape the future of our world?Add Outpost Simulator to your wishlist and get ready to carve your new home from the ashes of the old world. Remember, the DEMO will evolve with your feedback and ideas. We are eager to hear everything you have to share. So be sure to ju","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T11:00:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183788475","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3508880-1833334318566531","game_id":"steam-3508880","kind":"announcement","title":"A New Chapter: Expanding the Horizons of Outpost Simulator","summary":"We are excited to announce that, as Mental Dreams Games, we have signed a publishing agreement with Ultimate Games S.A. for our game Outpost Simulator!As a solo developer, I see this as a big milestone for me. Making a game on my own has been both fun and sometimes tough. With this partnership, the project will get a real boost in marketing, visibility, and overall operations.It’s worth noting that Ultimate Games is known for titles such as Crime Simulator, Thief Simulator 2, Ultimate Fishing, a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-20T15:08:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318566531","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3508880-1828894815564786","game_id":"steam-3508880","kind":"announcement","title":"DEVLOG #02 No stopping, keep going, with determination and perseverance!","summary":"When will you announce the release date?The game is currently still in development. As a solo developer, I can’t give a clear date yet. There is enough content to release a demo, however I’m currently focused on bug fixing and finding issues. In the past, I’ve seen that even successful demos received very negative feedback if they were buggy or poorly polished. That’s why I’m trying to avoid making mistakes while preparing a demo for you. However, as you can see, bugs can still occur during deve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-06T08:03:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815564786","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3508880-1822556746169750","game_id":"steam-3508880","kind":"announcement","title":"DEVLOG #01 First Devlog and first Updates.","summary":"Hello everyone, my regards,As of this month, we have reached 6,000+ wishlists, and this makes me incredibly happy. As a solo developer, seeing my project receive this much interest truly means a lot to me. I continue to develop the game and am trying to prepare a nice demo for you. The main campfire shown in the visuals and keeping customers warm is the top priority. When they enter the outpost, the first thing they do is warm up, and then they take care of their other needs. Of course, they pay","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-27T18:09:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746169750","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3508880-1818752592130898","game_id":"steam-3508880","kind":"announcement","title":"5,000+ Wishlists Reached — Thank You!","summary":"We’ve just passed 5,000 wishlists, and we want to say thank you to everyone who supported the game.Your interest and feedback mean a lot to us and help keep the project moving forward.We’re continuing development and will be sharing more updates soon. Thanks for being part of the journey! ːsteamhappyː","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-14T09:46:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592130898","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3508880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3508880":"2026-10-26T10:38:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3508880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:42Z"},"4899230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:43Z","last_success_at":